# D3-FO-001: A baking-powder formulation is not just sodium bicarbonate
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 30mL @ 20C
add v1 baking_powder 0.5g
add v2 water 30mL @ 20C
add v2 NaHCO3 0.15g
look v1
look v2
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
heat v1 8kJ
heat v2 8kJ
measure v1 thermometer
measure v2 thermometer
look v1
look v2
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
